formance-harness\\nProve lifecycle semantics, attach ownership neutrality, ax pane enforcement, replication exclusions, and historical translation. This is an implementation deliverable, not a specification rewrite.\\n====\\nTASK-260830-3bkz0c TASK-260830-3bkz0c: prove-shared-environment-implementation-boundary\\nEnforce one environment library behind Provider, Session Adapter, and Directory Node facades with shared fixtures and identity. This is an implementation deliverable, not a specification rewrite.\\n====\\nTASK-260830-7a0s2c TASK-260830-7a0s2c: build-fixture-fuzz-and-fault-test-infrastructure\\nBuild deterministic fixture runners, fake clocks, crash points, protocol fuzzing, hostile strings, and platform capability skips. This is an implementation deliverable, not a specification rewrite.\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 1132,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 283,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}"}}}
