{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000d873","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a076ec-3023-7ad0-af14-c3080467cd16"},"sequence":2708,"recorded_at":1780531400005411,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"29de407d-d987-4950-b9b4-211f15150d27","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"29de407d-d987-4950-b9b4-211f15150d27","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"29de407d-d987-4950-b9b4-211f15150d27"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"52aca2b2-1cef-48fc-ba64-a84bed4b960f"},"task_id":"52aca2b2-1cef-48fc-ba64-a84bed4b960f","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"52aca2b2-1cef-48fc-ba64-a84bed4b960f","chunk":"edited\nchanged lines: lines 75-81\n--- original\n+++ updated\n@@\n-// platformExempt names derived sites that need not fire on one GOOS,\n-// keyed file|constructor:rule. The post-check directory open fails\n-// deterministically only where mode bits are enforceable: the chmod\n-// vector in TestOpenNoFollowDirRefusesUnreadableDir is skipped on\n-// Windows (ACLs do not express a mode-000 directory) and as root\n-// (which bypasses mode bits), so on Windows the site is exempt. An\n-// exemption that resolves to no derived site fails as stale.\n+// platformExempt names rules that need not fire on one GOOS, keyed\n+// file|constructor:rule. The key is rule-level, not site-level: every\n+// \"open failed\" site in nofollow.go shares it. The post-check directory\n+// open fails deterministically only where mode bits are enforceable: the\n+// chmod vector in TestOpenNoFollowDirRefusesUnreadableDir is skipped on\n+// Windows (ACLs do not express a mode-000 directory) and as root (which\n+// bypasses mode bits), so on Windows the rule is exempt. An exemption\n+// that resolves to no derived site fails as stale.\n"}}}
